000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RRDSNATS.
000300*    RRDSSSEQ, written against native VSAM instead of VSAMIO.
000400*    Positions by record number, then reads five from there.
000500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000700 FILE-CONTROL.
000800     SELECT RRDS-FILE ASSIGN TO RRDSF01
000900         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
001000         ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
001100         RELATIVE KEY IS WS-RRN
001200         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001300 DATA DIVISION.
001400 FILE SECTION.
001500 FD  RRDS-FILE
001600     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001700     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
001800 01  RRDS-RECORD                 PIC X(80).
001900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002000 01  WS-RRN                      PIC 9(8) COMP VALUE 0.
002100 01  WS-STATUS                   PIC X(2)  VALUE '00'.
002200 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
002300     88  END-OF-FILE                       VALUE 'Y'.
002400 01  START-FAILED-SWITCH         PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
002500     88  START-FAILED                      VALUE 'Y'.
002600 01  RECORD-COUNTER              PIC S9(8) VALUE +0.
002700 01  SLOT-COUNTER                PIC S9(8) VALUE +0.
002800 01  COUNTER-EDIT                PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
002900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003000 000-INITIATE.
003100     DISPLAY 'RRDSSSEQ: READ RRDS SEQUENTIALLY (W/START)'.
003200     DISPLAY '------------------------------------------'.
003300     DISPLAY ' '.
003400     OPEN INPUT RRDS-FILE.
003500 010-PROCESS.
003600     PERFORM 110-PROCESS-DATA THRU 119-EXIT UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
003700 020-TERMINATE.
003800     CLOSE RRDS-FILE.
003900     STOP RUN.
004000 110-PROCESS-DATA.
004100     MOVE 21 TO WS-RRN.
004200     DISPLAY 'START RRN EQUAL TO 21'.
004300     MOVE 'N' TO START-FAILED-SWITCH.
004400     START RRDS-FILE KEY IS EQUAL TO WS-RRN
004500         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO START-FAILED-SWITCH.
004600     PERFORM 120-START-AND-READ THRU 129-EXIT.
004700     MOVE 51 TO WS-RRN.
004800     DISPLAY 'START RRN EQUAL TO 51'.
004900     MOVE 'N' TO START-FAILED-SWITCH.
005000     START RRDS-FILE KEY IS EQUAL TO WS-RRN
005100         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO START-FAILED-SWITCH.
005200     PERFORM 120-START-AND-READ THRU 129-EXIT.
005300     MOVE 81 TO WS-RRN.
005400     DISPLAY 'START RRN GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 81'.
005500     MOVE 'N' TO START-FAILED-SWITCH.
005600     START RRDS-FILE KEY IS NOT LESS THAN WS-RRN
005700         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO START-FAILED-SWITCH.
005800     PERFORM 120-START-AND-READ THRU 129-EXIT.
005900     MOVE 111 TO WS-RRN.
006000     DISPLAY 'START RRN GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 111'.
006100     MOVE 'N' TO START-FAILED-SWITCH.
006200     START RRDS-FILE KEY IS NOT LESS THAN WS-RRN
006300         INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO START-FAILED-SWITCH.
006400     PERFORM 120-START-AND-READ THRU 129-EXIT.
006500     MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
006600 119-EXIT.
006700     EXIT.
006800 120-START-AND-READ.
006900     IF START-FAILED
007000         DISPLAY 'PAST THE END, STATUS ' WS-STATUS.
007100     IF NOT START-FAILED
007200         PERFORM 122-READ-FIVE THRU 123-EXIT.
007300 129-EXIT.
007400     EXIT.
007500 122-READ-FIVE.
007600     MOVE WS-RRN TO SLOT-COUNTER.
007700     MOVE +0 TO RECORD-COUNTER.
007800     PERFORM 130-READ-AND-DISPLAY THRU 139-EXIT
007900         UNTIL END-OF-FILE OR RECORD-COUNTER > +4.
008000     MOVE 'N' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
008100 123-EXIT.
008200     EXIT.
008300 130-READ-AND-DISPLAY.
008400     READ RRDS-FILE
008500         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.
008600     IF NOT END-OF-FILE
008700         MOVE SLOT-COUNTER TO COUNTER-EDIT
008800         DISPLAY COUNTER-EDIT ': ' RRDS-RECORD
008900         ADD +1 TO SLOT-COUNTER.
009000     ADD +1 TO RECORD-COUNTER.
009100 139-EXIT.
009200     EXIT.
